title: "[Beslisboom] ForMemberIgnorePattern" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q1: "elke ForMember: d => d.X\nen o => o.Ignore() op CreateMap?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: not a CreateMap\nwithout options\n(string-name)"
q2: "genegeerd lid publiek\nop B aanwezig?" {shape: diamond}
m2: "Manual: does not have as a\npublic property or field\n(unittest)"
q3: "elk niet-genegeerd lid: bronlid\nzelfde naam en type?" {shape: diamond}
m3: "Manual: no member with the\nsame name (unmatched)"
f: "Fixed: ToB zonder genegeerde leden\n(simple, mixed)"
q1 -> m1: nee
q1 -> q2: ja
q2 -> m2: nee
q2 -> q3: ja
q3 -> m3: nee
q3 -> f: ja
